<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Leonard returns six months after intake. He has refereed full cards each week and taught his classes without breathlessness, chest tightness, palpitations or lightheadedness. His home readings over the past week averaged 120/76 mmHg. He takes losartan, amlodipine and atorvastatin every day; the ankle puffiness is slight. He feels less worried about money and sleeps better. He asked again about aspirin, which the cardiologist had raised. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Home blood pressure</td><td>Average 120/76 mmHg over seven days</td></tr><tr><td>Mood and worry</td><td>PHQ-9 2; GAD-7 3</td></tr><tr><td>Work</td><td>Full cards weekly without symptoms</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

